{
  "name": "club-biad",
  "description": "Club Biad: the demo club of the acceptance walk (pnpm db:seed:demo). Three bars, the club’s own floor of 76 tables ported from its paper plan plus three payment tables, and a Bulgarian club menu of about thirty articles. A table’s number is the plan’s spot name, so a spot, its table and its QR code are the same place. Three bills are already open, the same three the demo seed writes.",
